    "description_html": "<div>\n<div>\n<p>The Value Stick Pen is the perfect combination of affordability and functionality. Designed for bulk distribution, promotions, and everyday office use, this pen offers a clean, minimalistic white plastic barrel with a removable cap in black or blue.</p>\n<p><strong>Specifications</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Material</strong>: Lightweight white plastic barrel</li>\n<li><strong>Cap Colors</strong>: Black or Blue (barrel remains white)</li>\n<li><strong>Dimensions</strong>: 15cm x 1mm (+/-2mm tolerance)</li>\n<li><strong>Ink Color</strong>: Black</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Customization Options</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Printing Method</strong>: UV Inkjet Printing</li>\n<li><strong>Print Area</strong>: 90mm x 5mm</li>\n<li><strong>Full-Color Digital Printing</strong>: Crisp, professional branding with no setup fees or hidden charges</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Performance &amp; Benefits</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Reliable Ballpoint Ink</strong>: Smooth flow for effortless writing</li>\n<li><strong>Perfect for Various Uses</strong>: Ideal for trade shows, schools, businesses, and giveaways</li>\n<li><strong>Affordable Bulk Pricing</strong>: Enjoy volume discounts for large orders</li>\n<li><strong>Durable Design</strong>: Ensures extended usability</li>\n<li><strong>Lightweight and Durable</strong>: Easy to handle and built to last</li>\n<li><strong>Long-Lasting Black Ink</strong>: Provides a consistent writing experience</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Order Your Value Stick Pens Today!</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>Elevate your promotional efforts with a pen that combines affordability, style, and functionality. Customize your pen with full-color digital printing for crisp, professional branding. Click the \"Buy Now\" button and add these budget-friendly pens to your collection!</p>\n</div>\n</div>"
